			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize core submodules for OpenTelemetry and Cloudflare types\n\nUpdate multiple submodules to align the build environment with the latest upstream dependency patches and type definitions.\n\n**Cocoon** and **Wind** are updated to include OpenTelemetry minor versions (`@opentelemetry/sdk-logs` and `@opentelemetry/exporter-trace-otlp-http` from 0.216.0 to 0.217.0), ensuring telemetry compatibility.\n\n**Common** and **Echo** are synchronized to bump `@cloudflare/workers-types` to the latest daily build (`4.20260507.1`), reflecting upstream `workerd` changes.\n\n**Maintain** and **Rest** are advanced to their latest `Current` branch states to maintain consistency across the CI/CD toolchain and bundling pipeline.\n\nThese updates ensure the editor tooling and runtime layers leverage the latest security fixes and type safety without introducing breaking API changes.",
			"SHA": "ecbc7c97b36888ed527e34d2675824af88838c31"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-07T14:31:05Z",
